# African Drumming Intensive March 23

Experience and be immersed in Malian music at this African Drumming Intensive.  Nathaniel, our facilitator will have returned FRESH from West Africa to provide you with this unique African Drumming Intensive Workshop. This workshop is aimed at all levels, adults & children 8+.  Dont miss this once off opportunity.  This material has not been taught in our classes and will be a great introduction to courses beginning in Maleny and Palmwoods for April. Drums provided.  See you there. 1.30-3.30pm $35 Palmwoods Memorial Hall Ph 0434585992 or email:info@rhythmculture.com.au for bookings. Bookings essential
